{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！\nブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オーディション後"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての振り入れに全くついていけなくて困っていたら、最初から覚えるのが早くて上手だった武元さんが見本動画を撮らせてくれました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時から武元先生です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/IMG_4917.jpeg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "武元さんの中で1番好きな髪型👧\nあどけなくて可愛い"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "めちゃくちゃ意気投合してた時期。\n『RRR』は本当に面白い"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとも言えない表情。お気に入り写真"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-04.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "井上さんと大沼さんもパシャパシャ撮ってる📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-05.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちを繋げてくれたサクラミーツ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-06.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "哀愁漂う後ろ姿。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先頭に立って挑戦し続けてくれる武元さんの姿を見て、私もバラエティに向き合ってみようと思えました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-07.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツを守り続けたいって\nみんな思ってるから安心してね🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-08.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱい思い出作れてよかった\nありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/390/eb33d9f179ee97a392c79b0757dcb-09.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "綺麗だよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも武元さんが武元さんらしくいられるように、ずーーーっと応援してます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パワフルガール貫いてね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "卒業おめでとう💐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"ty